Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Come, New World
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 53
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, our world is truly destined to perish
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over—everything is over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, everything is just beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue’s voice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming from the rift
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, our world is on the brink of collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I’ve prepared a special gift for you all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,our bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,seem to be changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I’ve been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is the gift I want to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,what about our original world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t need that world anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we just need to fully enjoy this wonderful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,World…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue, how did you manage to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from me, it’s all thanks to…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, we’ll never fade away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving us this perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not perfect enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Weslie was sucked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so foolish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, why did you act on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.97,0:02:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, listen to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie! Don’t scare us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s the thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re a team, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me finish speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, why did you leave us behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me finish speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, why aren’t you sad at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that if you’re too sad, you lose your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy…he…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now even Mr. Slowy has gone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I tell them that Weslie is actually still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Weslie is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You—you need to get off me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we? Why is it so pitch black?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be inside Blue’s energy body right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did Blue swallow us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are we still safe and sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this magical artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re safe, sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but how are we supposed to stop him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re inside his body. That device should be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been a long time, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you stop clinging to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But Weslie said if we don’t stay close, we’ll get absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t you hug someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But you smell especially good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re done for, we’re done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m about to get sucked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re actually fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected this magical artifact to still work after being torn in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll split this half and give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, it’ll be much easier to move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to find the Absorption Device and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our world can return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely won’t
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,let him off the hook
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s so cool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? Right? So cool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get going
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s chase him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s gone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, he might…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the fog suddenly so thick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Could he be copying our abilities too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they suddenly turn on each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t attack—it’s us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:06:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Blue just a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s this fog; it’s making us hallucinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to attack each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a good thing you snapped us out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I’m staying right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be the goat right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s try to stay close as we move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We said we shouldn’t separate, but we don’t have to be glued together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How come we keep ending up back in the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t this where we fought earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we just been going in circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, quick, think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I used up so much energy in that fight; now I’m thirsty and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be nervous; it’s just the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That’s a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re so timid, how did you end up saving the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When you watch the world on the brink of destruction,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a surge of passion rises in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And your body instinctively wants to step forward
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect everything around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right—that’s exactly how I feel too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing you all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,is like seeing versions of myself with different personalities and experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a series finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it is the finale, I’m not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve prepared some outfit cards for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, once the mission is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s meet up again in a peaceful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve figured out a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason we were fooled by the mist before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,was that we trusted our eyes too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er, do you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, I hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a strange sound over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, shine a light over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the thing that’s been misleading us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry and catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the weapons belonging to the inn owner and Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there—it’s glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten about Peach’s magical artifact?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, why didn’t you say so earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Absorption Device is still running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Weslie’s move hasn’t worked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then isn’t Weslie in great danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry and go back him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister must be fighting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go fight as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let’s set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.31,0:11:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, can your body really handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve already found a way to restore your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you should stay behind and focus on restoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll head out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since neither Wolffy nor Weslie is around…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then the next step is…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Paddi caught it from him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s start the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
